+
+```csharp
+.AddTransientHttpErrorPolicy(p => p.WaitAndRetryAsync(
+    retryCount: ...,
+    sleepDurationProvider: ...,
+    ...
+))
+```
+
+Update it to include an `onRetry` parameter:
+
